Expat (libexpat)
================

Bundled verbatim in src/vendor/expat/.

Copyright (c) 1998-2000 Thai Open Source Software Center Ltd and Clark Cooper
Copyright (c) 2001-2025 Expat maintainers

Full text in src/vendor/expat/COPYING; contributors in
src/vendor/expat/AUTHORS. Upstream is https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat
and the pinned release, its checksum and the import date are recorded in
src/vendor/PROVENANCE.

The bundled files are unmodified. zuxml adds no code to that directory: the
build configuration Expat would normally generate with autotools or CMake is
kept outside it, in the project-owned src/expat_config.h, so that
tools/verify-vendor can prove the tree is byte-identical to upstream.

Only the parser library is bundled. Expat's xmlwf utility, examples, test
suite, fuzzers and build systems are not included.
